<title>USA: Fine Host names Randy Spector president.</title>
<headline>Fine Host names Randy Spector president.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fine Host Corp said Friday it had named Randy Spector as president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>As president, Spector succeeds Richard Kerley, who will remain chairman and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>The position of COO is newly created.</p>
<p>Spector has held a number of executive positions during his 10 years with Fine Host.</p>
